[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238401\">5510C18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237459\">1016A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237496\">1032C32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237493\">1032B59</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237454\">1008C14</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the right cylinder head camshaft\ncaps (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the left cylinder head camshafts complete with oil seals.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013496.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the right cylinder head camshafts complete\nwith new oil seals.</p><p>Fit the camshaft caps and fix them tightening\nthe bolts to the recommended torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Check that the camshaft oil seals\nare positioned correctly in their seatings.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT CAPS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.8 - 2.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237454\">1008C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237493\">1032B59</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237496\">1032C32</a></p><p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238400\">5510C16</a></p><p>Carry out op.\n                                          <a href=\"#/3237458\">1016A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237460\">1016A36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237557\">1072B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237461\">1016A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237453\">1008C10</a></p>"]]